<b><i>#Encodergasm Presents</i></b>

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.070
<i>kurikaesu kisetsu tachi ga</i>

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.070
<b>As the seasons continue their never ending cycle...</b>

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:18.700
<i>kokoro to karada wo aratte kureru</i>

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:18.700
<b>...they cleanse our hearts and bodies.</b>

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.080
<i>anata no naka ni aru</i>

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.080
<b>And the wounds inside yourself...</b>

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.290
<i>kizu kuchi wo itawari</i>

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.290
<b>...are mysteriously healed...</b>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.130
<i>fukaku iyashi ai nagara</i>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:30.130
<b>...as they work laboriously within you.</b>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:37.220
<i>honno chiisana tsubomi futari de sodateru</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:37.220
<b>A couple instinctively raises a tiny flower bud...</b>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.520
<i>ai dake de ii zutto</i>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.520
<b>...Only through their everlasting love.</b>

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.440
<i>soshite akai akai hanabira ga</i>

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.440
<b>And so...its red beyond red petals will...</b>

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.820
<i>aoi aoi hane ni naru</i>

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.820
<b>...bloom and change into blue beyond blue wings.</b>

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.330
<i>anata ni te no nukumori shinjite</i>

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.330
<b>You can believe in that warmth of these hands...</b>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.950
<i>naite naite yume tsumei deita</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.950
<b>...crying and crying as you build your dreams...</b>

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:06.830
<i>umarekawareru made</i>

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:06.830
<b>...until then day when we're both reborn.</b>

